MacBar's menu bar event construction and relay, explicit-window native image
capture, and display/window handling reference and adapt implementation
techniques from these Ice source files:

  Ice/MenuBar/MenuBarItems/MenuBarItemManager.swift
  Ice/MenuBar/MenuBarItems/MenuBarItemImageCache.swift
  Ice/Utilities/ScreenCapture.swift

MacBar implements this functionality in Objective-C, with its own collection
panel, identity policy, settings, generic click routing and bounded recovery
flow. These are modified implementations maintained by this repository;
MacBar is not an official Ice release. The upstream license text, including
its attribution, is retained in LICENSE.

